{"sourceUrl":"http://www.sugli.sjtu.edu.cn/stu_info/3032.html","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:03:34.741552+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"http://www.sugli.sjtu.edu.cn/stu_info/3032.html","html":"<div>\n<p> </p>\n<section>\n<p><span><span><span><span>   上海交通大学董浩云智能管理与物流研究院（中美物流研究院）是在我国物流业快速增长和国际化步伐不断加快的背景下，在国家发改委、交通运输部、上海市人民政府、香港董氏慈善基金会、美国商务部、美国佐治亚州政府的共同支持下，于2005年10月20日在上海交通大学成立。研究院由安泰经管学院、机械与动力工程学院、电信学院及船建学院共建，集现代物流相关的机械、信息、交通及管理等学科领域优势为一体。近20年来研究院在师资队伍建设、人才培养、科学研究及社会服务等方面，发展迅速，成绩显著。近年来，面向国家重大战略需求，研究院逐步从聚焦物流领域向智慧物流供应链、智能制造管理及现代服务工程管理等更宽的领域拓展，建设成为三大领域技术与管理交叉的科学研究、人才培养和社会服务的高端平台。研究院已经形成了一支国际化背景强的高水平师资队伍（含双聘和长期兼职教师），其中教育部长江学者特聘教授、杰出青年基金获得者等国家级人才计划入选者9人；承担了一大批国家级科研计划项目（含十多项重点重大项目，在MS、OR、JOC、POMS、IISE等顶尖国际期刊或权威期刊发表了一批高水平论文；研究还积极推进与中远海工、中信重工、美的集团等大型骨干企业和地方政府的合作，获得一批发明专利，获得多项省部级奖，产生巨大的经济与社会效益。研究院还依托其雄厚师资队伍、一流的科学研究成果和高水平的社会服务培养工程管理及物流领域国际化、高层次及创新型的才，满足新时期我国制造强国建设、双循环格局的构建及发展现代服务业的对于高层次专门化人才的需求。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>   根据教育部和上海交通大学有关研究生招生政策的文件规定，董浩云智能管理与物流研究院（中美物流研究院）将开展2027级博士研究生自主选拔招生工作，为一批优秀应届本科毕业生搭建高起点继续深造和发展的平台。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n</section>\n<p><span><b><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>招生专业代码：</font><font>120100</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></b></span></p>\n<p><span><b><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>招生专业名称：管理科学与工程</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></b></span></p>\n<p><span><b><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>招生类别：学术型博士（全日制）</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></b></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><b><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>一、申请资格</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></b></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>1、拥护中国共产党，热爱祖国，品德优良，遵纪守法，身心健康。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>2、诚实守信，学风端正，无任何考试作弊、剽窃他人学术成果以及其他违法违纪受处分记录。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>3、申请者应为国内重点高校及优势学科的在校三年级学生（2027年夏季毕业），学习成绩优秀，德智体美全面发展。非重点高校学生，如在学术研究、竞赛获奖等方面有突出表现的可以适当放宽；招收的学生本科专业包括：物流工程、物流管理、管理科学与工程、工业工程、工商管理、计算机科学与技术、运筹学与控制论、数学、机械工程（机械制造自动化）、自动化等专业。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>4、具有所在学校推荐免试研究生资格。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>5、数理功底扎实，</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>英语水平不低于上海交通大学推免基本要求</font><font>CET6≥425（TOEFL≥90或IELTS≥6.0），优先考虑英语水平优秀者；</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>6、有较强的创新能力、科研能力和实践能力。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><b><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>二、招生</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></b><b><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>导师列表</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></b></span></p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>招生导师名单</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>姓名</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>导师介绍及邮箱链接</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>耿娜</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>http://www.sugli.sjtu.edu.cn/teacher1/2346.html</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>张大力</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>http://www.sugli.sjtu.edu.cn/teacher1/2187.html</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>周利平</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>http://www.sugli.sjtu.edu.cn/teacher1/2398.html</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>备注：报考本批次直博生的同学请首先与导师取得联系；</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><b><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>三</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></b><b><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>、招生专业</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></b></span></p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><font>招生专业</font></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><font>学制</font><font>(年)</font></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><font>管理科学与工程</font></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><font>5</font></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><span><b><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>四</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></b><b><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>、申请材料</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></b></span></p>\n<p><span><b><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>1、报名</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></b></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>考生自行准备以下电子版和纸质版材料</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>，</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>电子版发邮件至</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>zs_sjtu_sugli@126.com<span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>，邮件主题：</font><font>XX大学XXX直博报名。纸质版材料需要在</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>报道</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>当天提交，报名材料不予退回：</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>1.上海交通大学董浩云智能管理与物流研究院（中美物流研究院）</font><font>2027级直博生报名汇总表；（</font></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><font><a href=\"http://www.sugli.sjtu.edu.cn/upload/file/20250807/20250807145131.xlsx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>点击下载</span></a></font></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><font>）</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>2.《上海交通大学董浩云智能管理与物流研究院（中美物流研究院）</font><font>2027级直博生报名表》扫描件（</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><a href=\"http://www.sugli.sjtu.edu.cn/upload/file/20260828/20260828163031.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>点击下载</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></a><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>，请打印填写并本人签字）；</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>3.本人第二代居民身份证件扫描件</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>4.本科成绩单</font><font>1份（加盖所在学校或者学院教务部门公章）；</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>5.本科学习成绩专业排名证明</font><font>1份（加盖所在学校或者学院教务部门公章）；</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>6.相关英语水平能力证明材料；</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>7.本人学籍认证报告，学信网上在线验证并下载；</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>8.其他材料（如获奖证书、发表论文、科研成果等）。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>注：</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>1.以上材料</font><font>1请发送电子EXCEL文件，2-8请按照顺序合成1份pdf文件，要求文件内容清晰、易辨认，EXCEL文件和PDF文件均按照“姓名+本科院校+本科专业”进行命名；现场只需提交2-8纸质版，也请按照上述顺序提前做好排序；</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>2.申请者须如实填写和上传相关信息，如有不实将被取消复试资格或拟录取资格；</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><b><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>2、报名截止</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></b><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>：2026年</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>9</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>月</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>7</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>日</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>（</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>周一）</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><b><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>3、其它注意事项</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></b></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>1</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>）报名截至日期后，进行初审。初审通过者参与面试，面试通知将邮件发出并在网站公示；</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>2）初审通过的直博生申请者将在研究院公布的计划招生的导师列表中选择导师；</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>3）要求申请者须如实填写相关信息，如有不实将被取消录取资格。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><b><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>五</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></b><b><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>、考核内容</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></b></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>主要考察学生的专业知识、英语水平、科研潜力及综合能力素质，具体考核方式及流程将在初审名单确定后另行通知。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><b><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>六</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></b><b><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>、录取政策</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></b></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>在推免中表现优异的学生将获得预录取资格，获得本科所在学校正式推免资格后将会被列入上海交通大学安泰经济与管理学院推免录取名单。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><b><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>七</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></b><b><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>、联系方式</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></b></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>地址：上海市徐汇区华山路</font><font>1954号，上海交大中院307室；</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>邮编：</font><font>200030；</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>电话：</font><font>13916636649</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>邮箱：</font><font>yz6519522@sjtu.edu.cn</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>联系人：郑老师</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>上海交通大学董浩云智能管理与物流研究院（中美物流研究院）</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>202</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>6</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>年</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>8</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>月2</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>8</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>日</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n</div>","textSha256":"fa928b7d0e6c597e313c3d9a09907e0eb2f6c39c89d015c56c014a07219ad8e8","textLength":2261,"sourceSha256":"3b67257c4435a06b7fae46e8c6bd10d7b9e2b1b55d1e6ea65b